<title>USA: MCI challenges U.S. West to open Washington.</title>
<headline>MCI challenges U.S. West to open Washington.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MCI Communications Corp said it asked state regulators to break a logjam in negotiations with U.S. West over MCI's entry into local markets.</p>
<p>It said its petition is intended to end months of stalled talks with the U.S. West concerning the interconnection and other issues.</p>
</text>
